<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA JANUARY TRACTOR SALES UP 28 PERCENT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA JANUARY TRACTOR SALES UP 28 PERCENT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African tractor sales jumped 28.1 percent to 378 units in January compared to 295 units in the same month a year ago, the South African Agricultural Machinery Association said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
